        {
          "name": "financial_evidence_review",
          "description": "Review Seiche dollar-funding benchmarks, LiquiLens covered-bank diagnostics and Undertow market liquidity in one bounded call. Bank is a literal name or ID filter; empty selects published coverage. Each section keeps its own dates, units, rights and limitations. No combined score or trade authorization. Revisions suppress identical rows, not evidence checks.",
